          <span class="tag">Organic Recovery</span>
          <h1 class="en">Recovering organic search from single-digit daily clicks.</h1>
          <h1 class="zh">从个位数点击恢复至每日约 100 次。</h1>
          <p class="body-copy en">
            WJS Home's daily GSC clicks fell sharply from approximately 100 to single digits. I used official Google documentation, GSC data, and affected page patterns to identify the primary content risks and develop a recovery plan. Following content consolidation and updates, daily clicks returned to approximately 100 within three months.
          </p>
          <p class="body-copy zh">
            WJS Home 的 GSC 日均点击量从约 100 次快速下降至个位数。我结合 Google 官方资料、GSC 数据和受影响页面特征确认主要内容风险并制定恢复计划。完成内容整合与更新后，日均点击在约 3 个月内恢复至此前约 100 次的水平。
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside class="case-meta">
          <span class="en"><strong>My Role:</strong> B2C SEO Strategist</span>
          <span class="en"><strong>Market:</strong> US E-commerce</span>
          <span class="en"><strong>Period:</strong> November 2025–July 2026</span>
          <span class="en"><strong>Data Source:</strong> Google Search Console &amp; GA4</span>
          <span class="zh"><strong>我的职责：</strong>B2C SEO Strategist</span>
