      <section class="workflow-section">
        <div class="workflow-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Workflow</p>
          <h2 class="en">From visibility loss to content recovery.</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">从可见度下降到内容恢复。</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow en">
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">01</span>
            <h2>Business Problem</h2>
            <p>Multiple pages lost visibility at the same time, and daily GSC clicks fell from approximately 100 to single digits.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">02</span>
            <h2>Data Diagnosis</h2>
            <p>I reviewed official Google guidance and exported the pages and queries with the largest click and ranking losses from GSC.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">03</span>
            <h2>Cause Assessment</h2>
            <p>Affected pages showed template-driven content, topic overlap, limited original insight, and insufficient supporting data.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">04</span>
            <h2>Optimization</h2>
            <p>I consolidated overlap and added authoritative data, transparent ranking criteria, original analysis, and differentiated content.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">05</span>
            <h2>Validation &amp; Learning</h2>
            <p>Daily clicks returned to approximately 100 within three months, supported by a clearer people-first content standard.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow zh">
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">01</span>
            <h2>业务问题</h2>
            <p>大量页面同时失去搜索可见度，GSC 日均点击量从约 100 次下降至个位数。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">02</span>
            <h2>数据诊断</h2>
            <p>查阅 Google 官方指南，并从 GSC 导出点击和排名损失最大的页面与查询。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">03</span>
            <h2>原因判断</h2>
            <p>受影响页面普遍存在模板化、主题重叠、原创观点不足和缺少数据依据等问题。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">04</span>
            <h2>优化执行</h2>
            <p>整合重复内容，补充权威数据、透明排名标准、原创分析和差异化内容。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">05</span>
            <h2>结果验证与复盘</h2>
            <p>日均点击在约 3 个月内恢复至约 100 次，并建立以用户价值为核心的内容标准。</p>
          </article>
        </div>

